sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant U as The owner
    participant WX as Channel servers
    participant CH as channel adapter
    participant H as core (hub role)
    participant N as node (embedded in single-machine mode)
    participant A as agent-dsh

    U->>WX: 「把桌面那堆图按日期整理一下」<br/>(tidy that pile of images on my desktop, by date)
    WX->>CH: receive (long-poll / long connection)
    CH->>H: InboundMessage
    H->>H: identify (if not the owner, drop silently, no reply)
    H->>H: routing　target device = the hub itself
    H->>H: session　(channel, user, device) → sessionId
    H->>N: dispatch the task
    N->>A: run(text, sessionId, cwd)
    Note over A,N: the receive loop is never blocked<br/>work is strictly serial
    A-->>N: onProgress
    N-->>H: progress
    H-->>CH: sendText
    CH-->>WX: working on it…
    WX-->>U: working on it…
    A-->>N: text + files
    N-->>H: result
    H->>H: add the ↩ quote prefix → chunk by length
    H->>CH: sendText / sendFile
    CH->>WX: send
    WX->>U: result + attachments
